      "en": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Hashem is always there for me, He is my guiding light and my Source of strength! Therefore, I have nothing to fear in life, not human enemies and physical war, nor spiritual battles and the yetzer hara, because אַחַת שֶׁאָלְתִּי מֵאֵת יְהֹוָה אוֹתָהּ—(though I have asked Hashem for all sorts of things that I feel I need, in truth) I have one overall goal for my life; שִׁבְתִּי בְּבֵית יְהֹוָה כָּל יְמֵי חַיַּי, that—לַחֲזוֹת בְּנֹעַם יְהֹוָה וּלְבַקֵּר בְּהֵיכָלוֹ "
            }
          ],
          "anchorLine": 0
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Please, Hashem,—אַל תַּסְתֵּר פָּנֶיךָ מִמֶּנִּי do not hide Your Presence and light from me! הוֹרֵנִי יְהֹוָה דַּרְכֶּךָ—Show me the right path and help me make the correct decisions. קַוֵּה אֵל יְהֹוָה—(Proclaims David HaMelech:) \"Put your trust in Hashem; (and) חֲזַק וְיַאֲמֵץ לִבֶּךָ—that itself will give you the courage and strength to persevere! (And if Hashem has not yet given you what you asked for); וְקַוֵּה—"
            }
          ],
          "anchorLine": 8
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "אֶל יְהֹוָה—continue to place your trust in Hashem (for all that He does is for your best).\""
            }
          ],
          "anchorLine": 13
        }
      ],
